@startuml policy_io
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Numeric TypeScript / Burn process boundary
component "TypeScript recipient planning\n2271-coordinate state/action encoder" as ACTOR <<app>>
component "Zod request contract\nfeature version + 1..512 candidate rows" as REQUEST <<app>>
component "policy-score CONFIG_JSON NATIVE_RECORD\none JSON request through stdin EOF" as PROCESS <<app>>
component "Serde + FeatureBatch validation" as VALIDATE <<app>>
component "Frozen Burn F64 inference model" as MODEL <<app>>
database "Burn-native checkpoint\nSHA-256 = modelId" as RECORD <<db>>
component "Standard JSON model configuration\nfeature version + dimensions + record SHA-256" as CONFIG <<app>>
ACTOR --> REQUEST
REQUEST --> PROCESS : numeric values only; max 8 MiB
PROCESS --> VALIDATE
RECORD --> MODEL
CONFIG --> PROCESS : validate configuration and record binding
VALIDATE --> MODEL : modelId must match record bytes
MODEL --> ACTOR : JSON logits + requestId + modelId
note bottom of PROCESS
  Native record <= 1 MiB; no training or checkpoint writes.
  A one-shot scorer grants no renewed meter or deadline.
  Host admission, episode supervision and feature semantics remain pending.
end note
@enduml
